---
/* Guides & stories. */
---

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head--row reveal">
        <div class="section-head__text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Guides &amp; stories</span>
          <h2>Straight answers before you buy</h2>
          <p class="lead" style="margin-top:14px">What we get asked most, written out properly — so you can choose with confidence.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" href="shop.html">See the collection</a>
      </div>
      <div class="post-grid">
        <article class="post reveal">
          <div class="post__media"><img src="assets/img/opt/blush-linea-set.jpg" srcset="assets/img/opt/blush-linea-set-480.jpg 480w, assets/img/opt/blush-linea-set.jpg 1000w" sizes="(min-width:900px) 30vw, 88vw" alt="Cream boucle sectional" width="900" height="675" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="post__body">
            <span class="post__date">Buying guide</span>
            <h3>Boucle, corduroy or floral? Picking your fabric</h3>
            <p>Every fabric we build in, how each one wears in an Ibadan home, and which suits a busy family living room.</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="shop.html#cat-sofas">See the sofas
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="post reveal" data-delay="1">
          <div class="post__media"><img src="assets/img/opt/royal-kinging-set.jpg" srcset="assets/img/opt/royal-kinging-set-480.jpg 480w, assets/img/opt/royal-kinging-set.jpg 1000w" sizes="(min-width:900px) 30vw, 88vw" alt="The Royal Kinging Set" width="900" height="675" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="post__body">
            <span class="post__date">From the workshop</span>
            <h3>Inside the Royal Kinging Set: three months of handwork</h3>
            <p>Treated frames, high-density foam, leather and floral fabric, gold applied by hand — how our biggest commission comes together.</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I would like to ask about commissioning a Royal Kinging Set.">Ask about a commission
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="post reveal" data-delay="2">
          <div class="post__media"><img src="assets/img/opt/hero-sectionals.jpg" srcset="assets/img/opt/hero-sectionals-480.jpg 480w, assets/img/opt/hero-sectionals.jpg 1000w" sizes="(min-width:900px) 30vw, 88vw" alt="Sectional sofa in a living room" width="900" height="675" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="post__body">
            <span class="post__date">How to</span>
            <h3>Measuring your room for a sectional</h3>
            <p>The four measurements to send us before you order, and the mistakes that make a good sofa feel too big.</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="shop.html#cat-sets">See the full sets
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

